{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"story_kroos2_set_1_story_1","storyGroup":"story_kroos2_set_1","storySort":0,"storyDependence":null,"storyCanShow":0,"storyCode":null,"storyName":"蒙眬","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"克洛丝得闲一日，到尚蜀的山中游览，遇见了一位神秘女子。那女子包藏祸心，却被那眼睛似睁非睁之人洞悉了一切。","storyCanEnter":0,"storyTxt":"obt/memory/story_kroos2_1_1","avgTag":"幕间","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":0,"requiredStages":null,"characters":["乌有","克洛丝","？？？","面色青灰的女子","阿尹","克洛丝？","劫匪","山农","芬","格瑞斯教官","米格鲁","自东边来的声音","自西边来的声音","自上方来的声音"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_bg_35_g13_yanlivingroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":4},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":5},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":6},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_normal_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":7,"musicid":0},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":8},{"type":"character","slot":"m","name":"avgnew_455_nothing_1#11$1","id":9},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乌有","text":"万万不可啊恩人！恩人已经为了我又花钱又花时间，要是再耽误恩人一天，我这辈子都还不完您的恩情了！","id":10,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avgnew_455_nothing_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avgnew_455_nothing_1#7$1","id":11},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乌有","text":"您看，本来没我这腿伤，我们是要直接赶去与炎熔恩人会合的。现在，您正好有机会去好好游览一番了呀。正所谓因祸得福——","id":12,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/51/Avg_avgnew_455_nothing_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1021_kroos2_1#2$1","id":13},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝","text":"我知道你是一番好意。但是，就算你不需要照顾，我们的经费还得用到抵达办事处为止，没有多的钱出去游玩了。","id":14,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/ff/Avg_avg_1021_kroos2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avgnew_455_nothing_1#11$1","id":15},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乌有","text":"哎呀，我怎么那么糊涂！恩人用经费垫付了我的医药费，这才囊中羞涩。","id":16,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avgnew_455_nothing_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avgnew_455_nothing_1#7$1","id":17},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乌有","text":"恩人放心，游山玩水又何必去景点人挤人，尚蜀除了三山十七峰，还有许多值得一看的景色，保证您不花一分钱就能玩得尽兴。","id":18,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/51/Avg_avgnew_455_nothing_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avgnew_455_nothing_1#1$1","id":19},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乌有","text":"我这就给您推荐几条游览路线。","id":20,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/ba/Avg_avgnew_455_nothing_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1021_kroos2_1#5$1","id":21},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝","text":"嗯......你手里那张报纸上的风景照看起来就很美。","id":22,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a0/Avg_avg_1021_kroos2_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avgnew_455_nothing_1#11$1","id":23},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乌有","text":"哎呀，这是讲当地怪谈的报纸，这上面的地方可去不得，怕有脏东西......","id":24,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avgnew_455_nothing_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1021_kroos2_1#3$1","id":25},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝","text":"脏东西？我注意一点就行。帮我找找那里的地址吧。","id":26,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d8/Avg_avg_1021_kroos2_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":27},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":28},{"type":"charslot","id":29},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c3/Avg_bg_25_g06_mountainroad_d.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":30},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":31},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":32},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":33},{"type":"text","text":"烟际山，整座山被细雪与薄雾笼罩，如同世外仙境，每年仅初春的那个月方能赏到这般景色。","id":34},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1021_kroos2_1#1$1","id":35},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝","text":"呼——好清新。真是选了个好地方。","id":36,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_1021_kroos2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1021_kroos2_1#8$1","id":37},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝","text":"嗯？“游览路线一，普通路线，行程二十分钟；路线二，登高路线，行程两小时。”","id":38,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_avg_1021_kroos2_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1021_kroos2_1#7$1","id":39},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝","text":"“注意：路线二岔路较多，道路崎岖，务必沿主路行走，避免发生危险。”","id":40,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8d/Avg_avg_1021_kroos2_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1021_kroos2_1#1$1","id":41},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝","text":"登高路线啊......上面的风景一定更好看。从哪里上去呢？","id":42,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_1021_kroos2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":43},{"type":"text","text":"她顺着指示牌的箭头，见到一条隐蔽小路，蜿蜒地通向深山。","id":44},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1021_kroos2_1#10$1","id":45},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝","text":"这是主路？好像只有这条路可选了，先探探路吧。","id":46,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_1021_kroos2_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":47},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"slider","inverse":"true","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":48},{"type":"charslot","id":49},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":50},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c3/Avg_bg_25_g06_mountainroad_d.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":51},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":52},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"slider","inverse":"true","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":53},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1021_kroos2_1#3$1","id":54},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝","text":"嘶，进了深山就感觉好冷。","id":55,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d8/Avg_avg_1021_kroos2_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":56},{"type":"charslot","id":57},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":58},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_smog","fade":"true","fadetime":"2","layer":"2","id":59},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":60},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1021_kroos2_1#6$1","id":61},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝","text":"看不清指路牌了。雾怎么突然变这么浓了？再继续向上走有风险啊......","id":62,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/30/Avg_avg_1021_kroos2_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1021_kroos2_1#5$1","id":63},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝","text":"嗯？来的时候有这么多条路吗？脚印这么乱，认不出哪一条是刚走上来的路了......","id":64,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a0/Avg_avg_1021_kroos2_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1021_kroos2_1#3$1","id":65},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝","text":"通讯器——没信号了，导航也指望不上了。糟糕。","id":66,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d8/Avg_avg_1021_kroos2_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":67},{"type":"charslot","id":68},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_drtywndblw","volume":"0.8","id":69},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":70},{"type":"text","text":"阴冷的风吹来了隐隐约约的女子轻笑声。","id":71},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1021_kroos2_1#5$1","id":72},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝","text":"啊，那里有人？说不定可以问路。","id":73,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a0/Avg_avg_1021_kroos2_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":74},{"type":"charslot","id":75},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":76},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.2","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"40","randomness":"70","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":77},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":78},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1021_kroos2_1#7$1","id":79},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝","text":"哎呀，好硬。","id":80,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8d/Avg_avg_1021_kroos2_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":81},{"type":"text","text":"绊到克洛丝的是一个小土堆，土堆上竖着一块木牌，刻有两列字。","id":82},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1021_kroos2_1#2$1","id":83},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝","text":"“顾老九之坟”。","id":84,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/ff/Avg_avg_1021_kroos2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1021_kroos2_1#3$1","id":85},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝","text":"“掘坟盗宝者，烂手烂脚，倒霉一世”？","id":86,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d8/Avg_avg_1021_kroos2_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1021_kroos2_1#2$1","id":87},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝","text":"哎呀，这下面安葬着一位死者。但是，不多说这一句，也没人知道下面有宝物呀？","id":88,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/ff/Avg_avg_1021_kroos2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":89},{"type":"text","text":"克洛丝好奇地拨开薄薄一层土，果然土里藏着一枚沉甸甸的银元宝。银元宝闪烁着诱人的金属光泽，就这么无人看管地躺在地上。","id":90},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1021_kroos2_1#2$1","id":91},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝","text":"看起来是用贵金属做的，银？","id":92,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/ff/Avg_avg_1021_kroos2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝","text":"嗯......这下如何是好呢？","id":93,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/ff/Avg_avg_1021_kroos2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1021_kroos2_1#5$1","id":94},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝","text":"（东张西望）","id":95,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a0/Avg_avg_1021_kroos2_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1021_kroos2_1#1$1","id":96},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝","text":"好，就这么办吧。","id":97,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_1021_kroos2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":98},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_304_1#1$1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1","block":"true","id":99},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"给我......","id":100,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_avg_npc_304_1$1.png"},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":101},{"type":"dialog","id":102},{"type":"charslot","id":103},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$darkness01_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_dia_darkness01_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":104,"musicid":1},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"70","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":105},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1021_kroos2_1#3$1","id":106},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"200,0","duration":"1","block":"true","id":107},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":108},{"type":"text","text":"克洛丝猛退一大步，与突然出现在身前的声音拉开距离，同时手中的弩蓄势待发。","id":109},{"type":"text","text":"她定了定神，才看清悄然出现在眼前的，是一名面色青灰的布衣女子。女子垂手而立，直勾勾地盯着她。","id":110},{"type":"charslot","id":111},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_304_1#1$1","id":112},{"type":"dialogue","name":"面色青灰的女子","text":"是你拿的，还给我......还给我......","id":113,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_avg_npc_304_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1021_kroos2_1#3$1","id":114},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝","text":"欸？我拿了什么？","id":115,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d8/Avg_avg_1021_kroos2_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_304_1#1$1","id":116},{"type":"dialogue","name":"面色青灰的女子","text":"呵呵呵......装傻......你满手是土，你掘走了我的......我的宝贝！","id":117,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_avg_npc_304_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1021_kroos2_1#2$1","id":118},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝","text":"你出现得很凑巧。你去看看，你的宝贝还在不在那里。","id":119,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/ff/Avg_avg_1021_kroos2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":120},{"type":"text","text":"面色青灰的女子怀疑地盯着她，缓慢蹲下，发现原本薄薄的一层土变成了厚厚的一层落叶与泥土的混合物，并被压得十分紧实。","id":121},{"type":"text","text":"待女子扒开那层泥，下面赫然便是那块银元宝。","id":122},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_304_1#1$1","id":123},{"type":"dialogue","name":"面色青灰的女子","text":"你......","id":124,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_avg_npc_304_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1021_kroos2_1#9$1","id":125},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝","text":"对了，这木牌上的字我也替你抹掉了。下次可要小心些。","id":126,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_1021_kroos2_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1021_kroos2_1#1$1","id":127},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝","text":"趁天还亮着，我先去找下山的路了。再见。","id":128,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_1021_kroos2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_304_1#1$1","id":129},{"type":"dialogue","name":"面色青灰的女子","text":"你......别走！","id":130,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_avg_npc_304_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"面色青灰的女子","text":"刚才是我错怪了你，我须得好好赔礼道歉。","id":131,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_avg_npc_304_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"面色青灰的女子","text":"跟我来吧。我的小屋就在左近，去我那儿喝杯热茶吧。等雾散了，我送你下山。","id":132,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_avg_npc_304_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1021_kroos2_1#1$1","id":133},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝","text":"这附近竟有人家？好，那就打扰了。","id":134,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_1021_kroos2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":135},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":136},{"type":"charslot","id":137},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7a/Avg_bg_bg_indoor.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":138},{"type":"bgeffect","id":139},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":140},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":141},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":142},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1021_kroos2_1#5$1","id":143},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝","text":"（好像是走过的路。刚才没看见这里有房子啊？）","id":144,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a0/Avg_avg_1021_kroos2_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1021_kroos2_1#3$1","id":145},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝","text":"（咳咳！好大的灰......一股土味......）","id":146,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d8/Avg_avg_1021_kroos2_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_304_1#1$1","id":147},{"type":"dialogue","name":"面色青灰的女子","text":"请随便坐吧。","id":148,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_avg_npc_304_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"面色青灰的女子","text":"我叫阿尹，是尚蜀本地人。你呢？我见过那么多人，却听不出你的口音是哪里的。","id":149,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_avg_npc_304_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1021_kroos2_1#11$1","id":150},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝","text":"我不是炎国人，只不过在不少国家待过，现在的工作又能接触到各国的人，口音自然是杂了。","id":151,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a0/Avg_avg_1021_kroos2_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_304_1#1$1","id":152},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿尹","text":"不是炎国人？原来如此！哈哈，难怪，难怪！","id":153,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_avg_npc_304_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1021_kroos2_1#2$1","id":154},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝","text":"难怪？","id":155,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/ff/Avg_avg_1021_kroos2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_304_1#1$1","id":156},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿尹","text":"你可认识我手里这枚是什么？","id":157,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_avg_npc_304_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1021_kroos2_1#1$1","id":158},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝","text":"是银吧，一种贵金属，炎国之外也是能见到的。","id":159,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_1021_kroos2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_304_1#1$1","id":160},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿尹","text":"错啦！这岂是普通的金属？它是钱呀！","id":161,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_avg_npc_304_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1021_kroos2_1#2$1","id":162},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝","text":"啊......货币。我来了那么多天，没见到有人用过这种。但如果它的价值很高，平时难以见到倒也正常。","id":163,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/ff/Avg_avg_1021_kroos2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_304_1#1$1","id":164},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿尹","text":"当然！这么大一枚银元宝，足足五十两，只此一枚，便是许多人一生都挣不到的。","id":165,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_avg_npc_304_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿尹","text":"若是有了它，便是买下一整间宅院都没有问题，更不用说胭脂水粉，锦衣玉食。","id":166,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_avg_npc_304_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿尹","text":"你没有贪图钱财，这很好。否则，我一个手无缚羽之力的弱女子，又怎么保得住它......","id":167,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_avg_npc_304_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":168},{"type":"text","text":"阿尹当着克洛丝的面将银元宝塞进衣服里。从衣服隆起的形状来看，布料下藏着的元宝不止一枚。","id":169},{"type":"text","text":"阿尹似是被硌得不舒服，抱怨着揉了揉，衣服中传出金属的摩擦声。","id":170},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1021_kroos2_1#5$1","id":171},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝","text":"雾什么时候会散呢......","id":172,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a0/Avg_avg_1021_kroos2_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_304_1#1$1","id":173},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿尹","text":"快着呢。我歇一会儿，你，请自便吧。","id":174,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_avg_npc_304_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿尹","text":"不过抱歉，并非我不相信你，只是贪婪之徒并不会将贪婪二字写在脸上，我带重宝在身，须得做一些防备。","id":175,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_avg_npc_304_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":176},{"type":"text","text":"阿尹说完，拔出一把短剑，和衣而睡。起先，她用手牢牢护住藏了银元宝之处，不一会儿便发出均匀的呼吸声，手也渐渐松开了短剑。","id":177},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1021_kroos2_1#5$1","id":178},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝","text":"......","id":179,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a0/Avg_avg_1021_kroos2_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1021_kroos2_1#2$1","id":180},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝","text":"呵......啊......","id":181,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/ff/Avg_avg_1021_kroos2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":182},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1021_kroos2_1#3$1","id":183},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"50,0","duration":"1","block":"true","id":184},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝","text":"（无声地慢慢走近阿尹）","id":185},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":186},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"60,-20","duration":"1","block":"true","id":187},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝","text":"（收走她手中的短剑）","id":188},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":189},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝","text":"（将手缓缓探入阿尹的怀中，取出一物）","id":190},{"type":"charslot","id":191},{"type":"text","text":"阿尹猛地睁开眼，伸手想要抓住克洛丝的手腕，却被敏捷地躲过。她瞪大了眼，看到克洛丝一手握着那柄短剑，另一只手......","id":192},{"type":"text","text":"却握着从她怀中取出的剑鞘，正准备收剑入鞘。而她摸了摸衣服里的银元宝，一枚不少。","id":193},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1021_kroos2_1#2$1","id":194},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝","text":"本来不想吵醒你的。","id":195,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/ff/Avg_avg_1021_kroos2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1021_kroos2_1#8$1","id":196},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝","text":"没有经过特殊训练的人，手握出鞘的兵刃入睡实在太危险了。","id":197,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_avg_1021_kroos2_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝","text":"至少我在的期间，你不用担心财物丢失，把剑收起来吧。","id":198,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_avg_1021_kroos2_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_304_1#1$1","id":199},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿尹","text":"你！你究竟......！","id":200,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_avg_npc_304_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1021_kroos2_1#2$1","id":201},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝","text":"嗯？","id":202,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/ff/Avg_avg_1021_kroos2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_304_1#1$1","id":203},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿尹","text":"没什么！我继续睡了！","id":204,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_avg_npc_304_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":205},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","id":206},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","afrom":"1","ato":"0","posto":"0,-150","duration":"1.5","block":"true","id":207},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":208},{"type":"charslot","id":209},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1021_kroos2_1#5$1","id":210},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝","text":"......","id":211,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a0/Avg_avg_1021_kroos2_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝","text":"好安静的雪......","id":212,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a0/Avg_avg_1021_kroos2_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":213},{"type":"dialog","id":214},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":215},{"type":"backgroundtween","yFrom":"0","yTo":"20","duration":"1","block":"false","id":216},{"type":"curtain","direction":"0","fillfrom":"0.01","fillto":"0.2","grad":"true","fadetime":"2","id":217},{"type":"curtain","direction":"4","fillfrom":"0.01","fillto":"0.2","grad":"true","fadetime":"2","id":218},{"type":"bg","id":219,"from":"0","to":"1","duration":"1","block":"false"},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":220},{"type":"backgroundtween","yFrom":"20","yTo":"300","duration":"1","block":"false","id":221},{"type":"curtain","direction":"0","fillfrom":"0.2","fillto":"1","grad":"true","fadetime":"1.5","id":222},{"type":"curtain","direction":"4","fillfrom":"0.2","fillto":"1","grad":"true","fadetime":"1.5","id":223},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":224},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":225},{"type":"charslot","id":226},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9f/Avg_bg_bg_newiceforest_1.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":227},{"type":"bg","id":228,"from":"1","to":"0","duration":"0","block":"false"},{"type":"curtain","direction":"0","fillfrom":"1","fillto":"0","grad":"true","fadetime":"0","id":229},{"type":"curtain","direction":"4","fillfrom":"1","fillto":"0","grad":"true","fadetime":"0","id":230},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$drift_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_drift_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":231,"musicid":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":232},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":233},{"type":"text","text":"密林之中，被劫的镖车横卧在地，受伤的镖师被刀逼到树下。","id":234},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝？","text":"欸，怎么到了这里？小屋呢？","id":235},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_303_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":236},{"type":"dialogue","name":"劫匪","text":"送镖的，你回去与你们的林总镖头说，他既然不顾自己英雄好汉的名声，与那贪官刘喻勾结，我褐衣帮便替他积功德。","id":237,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_303_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"劫匪","text":"这一箱民脂民膏，取之于民，还之于民，用于赈那三月至今的旱灾。","id":238,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_303_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"劫匪","text":"他林总镖头若是被贪念迷了眼，硬要于天下人不义，便尽管找我们清算。记住了吗？滚！","id":239,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_303_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"劫匪","text":"哈哈，草包镖师，放他们点血吓唬吓唬就跑光了。喂，让你去检查货物，检查得怎么样了？发什么呆，说你呢！","id":240,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_303_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_303_1#1$1","focus":"n","id":241},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝？","text":"我？","id":242},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_303_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":243},{"type":"dialogue","name":"劫匪","text":"这里还有别人吗？！箱子里的银子，有没有两千两？","id":244,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_303_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_303_1#1$1","focus":"n","id":245},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝？","text":"呃......我去看看。","id":246},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝？","text":"两千两......是多少啊？这箱子完好无损，应该没少吧？","id":247},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_303_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":248},{"type":"dialogue","name":"劫匪","text":"应该？你连箱子都没打开，就敢说没少？让开！","id":249,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_303_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":250},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_open_woodbox","id":251},{"type":"charslot","id":252},{"type":"text","text":"那劫匪砸开了木箱，亮得刺眼的银元宝整整齐齐地摆在里头。他从中取出两枚，丢了一枚给“克洛丝”，随后合上木箱。","id":253},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_303_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":254},{"type":"dialogue","name":"劫匪","text":"没规矩。","id":255,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_303_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_303_1#1$1","focus":"n","id":256},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝？","text":"我不明白，劳烦说说这规矩。本来没少的银元宝，被你我拿了，不就变少了吗？","id":257},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_303_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":258},{"type":"dialogue","name":"劫匪","text":"你傻了不成？你好好的箱子交上去了，寨子里的长老要怎么处置？","id":259,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_303_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_303_1#1$1","focus":"n","id":260},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝？","text":"欸？","id":261},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_303_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":262},{"type":"dialogue","name":"劫匪","text":"这箱子本来就是破的。银元宝在斗殴中少了几枚。至于少了多少，咱俩把箱子交上去，李长老自当定夺。","id":263,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_303_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"劫匪","text":"他定夺完了，再往上交，陆副手也须定夺一番。而后交给大王，大王手下那几位都得定夺一番。","id":264,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_303_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"劫匪","text":"最后留个一两枚银元宝分给那些难民，他们便该谢天谢地了！","id":265,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_303_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"劫匪","text":"本来也轮不到你，但既然跟着我出来做事，自然也少不了你好处。记住了吗！","id":266,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_303_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_303_1#1$1","focus":"n","id":267},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝？","text":"原来是我没规矩了。","id":268},{"type":"dialog","id":269},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_303_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":270},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_arrow","id":271},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":272},{"type":"playsound","key":"$bodyfalldown2","id":273},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","afrom":"1","ato":"0","posto":"0,-150","duration":"1.5","block":"true","focus":"m","id":274},{"type":"delay","time":"1.6","id":275},{"type":"charslot","id":276},{"type":"dialogue","name":"劫匪","text":"你......！竟想独吞？你去哪里！","id":277},{"type":"text","text":"“克洛丝”带着箱子向受灾的地区走去，密林归于宁静。只有那枚被贪去的银元宝，从劫匪的身上掉落出来。","id":278},{"type":"dialog","id":279},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"slider","inverse":"true","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":280},{"type":"charslot","id":281},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":282},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9f/Avg_bg_bg_newiceforest_1.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":283},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":284},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"slider","inverse":"true","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":285},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝？","text":"咦，我怎么又回到了这个地方？","id":286},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_140#2","focus":"m","id":287},{"type":"dialogue","name":"山农","text":"土匪内讧的地儿应该就在这附近。看这里脚印这么密，和我们一样想法的人多得很，不过......","id":288,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/40/Avg_avg_npc_140-2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"山农","text":"这些天总听说有人捡到银元宝，却没人真正见过。看来，真货还在这山上呢。","id":289,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/40/Avg_avg_npc_140-2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_140#2","focus":"n","id":290},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝？","text":"银元宝？","id":291},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_140#2","focus":"m","id":292},{"type":"dialogue","name":"山农","text":"足足两千两呢。","id":293,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/40/Avg_avg_npc_140-2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_140#2","focus":"n","id":294},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝？","text":"（说的难道是褐衣帮在这里的那场内讧？我不是已经把那些银钱分给难民了？）","id":295},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝？","text":"（不对，我想带着银钱下山，然后，然后......？）","id":296},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_140#2","focus":"m","id":297},{"type":"dialogue","name":"山农","text":"那帮土匪平时称兄道弟，结果还是为了点身外物送了性命。咱俩要是有所得，可不能瞒着对方啊。","id":298,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/40/Avg_avg_npc_140-2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_140#2","focus":"n","id":299},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝？","text":"嗯......","id":300},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝？","text":"这里白茫茫一片雪，就算传言为真，银元宝也早被压在下面了。你打算上哪儿找去？","id":301},{"type":"charslot","id":302},{"type":"text","text":"山农不吭声，挥舞着锄头，几乎将山道的土翻遍，满头大汗，却一无所获。","id":303},{"type":"text","text":"仿佛故意要人发现一般，便在此刻，被“克洛丝”踏过的雪中露出了一点金属色。她躬身将它挖出来，那正是一枚沉重的银元宝。","id":304},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_140#1","focus":"m","id":305},{"type":"dialogue","name":"山农","text":"顾老九？怎么了，发现什么了？......这么大一枚！","id":306,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/58/Avg_avg_npc_140-1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_140#1","focus":"n","id":307},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝？","text":"（顾老九？好熟悉的名字，今天在哪里见过......啊，那个土坟的木牌上。）","id":308},{"type":"dialog","id":309},{"type":"playsound","key":"$flashback","volume":"0.8","id":310},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":311},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":312},{"type":"charslot","id":313},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c3/Avg_bg_25_g06_mountainroad_d.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":314},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0.8","keep":"true","id":315},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":316},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":317},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1021_kroos2_1#2$1","id":318},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝","text":"“顾老九之坟”。","id":319,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/ff/Avg_avg_1021_kroos2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1021_kroos2_1#3$1","id":320},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝","text":"“掘坟盗宝者，烂手烂脚，倒霉一世”？","id":321,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d8/Avg_avg_1021_kroos2_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":322},{"type":"playsound","key":"$flashback","volume":"0.8","id":323},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":324},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":325},{"type":"charslot","id":326},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9f/Avg_bg_bg_newiceforest_1.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":327},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","amount":"0","block":"true","id":328},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":329},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":330},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1021_kroos2_1#5$1","id":331},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝","text":"原来如此。","id":332,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a0/Avg_avg_1021_kroos2_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_140#1","focus":"m","id":333},{"type":"dialogue","name":"山农","text":"这......这下好了，我女儿的病有救了......对吧？银钱你会......分给我的吧？","id":334,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/58/Avg_avg_npc_140-1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1021_kroos2_1#1$1","id":335},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝","text":"锄头不用握得这么紧哦，给。","id":336,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_1021_kroos2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_140#1","focus":"m","id":337},{"type":"dialogue","name":"山农","text":"真的就这么给我了？那你自己呢？这么大一笔钱，你自己，不需要吗......","id":338,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/58/Avg_avg_npc_140-1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1021_kroos2_1#11$1","id":339},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝","text":"我啊......","id":340,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a0/Avg_avg_1021_kroos2_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":341},{"type":"playsound","key":"$flashback","volume":"0.8","id":342},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":343},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":344},{"type":"charslot","id":345},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_bg_bg_corridor.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":346},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0.8","keep":"true","id":347},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":348},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":349},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":350},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_123_fang_1#6","id":351},{"type":"dialogue","name":"芬","text":"克洛丝，跟我回去值日！","id":352,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9e/Avg_avg_123_fang_1-6.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":353},{"type":"playsound","key":"$flashback","volume":"0.8","id":354},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":355},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":356},{"type":"charslot","id":357},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7f/Avg_bg_bg_trainingcom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":358},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_013_riop","id":359},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":360},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":361},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格瑞斯教官","text":"我们的存在意义之一，就是为你们提供一个背影。","id":362,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/96/Avg_char_013_riop.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":363},{"type":"playsound","key":"$flashback","volume":"0.8","id":364},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":365},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":366},{"type":"charslot","id":367},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f8/Avg_bg_bg_indoor_u.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":368},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_122_beagle_1","id":369},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":370},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":371},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米格鲁","text":"好啦，别这么哭丧着脸，笑一个！你还要去芬那边呢！","id":372,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/20/Avg_char_122_beagle_1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米格鲁","text":"下次记得帮我带哥伦比亚的土特产呀！","id":373,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/20/Avg_char_122_beagle_1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":374},{"type":"playsound","key":"$flashback","volume":"0.8","id":375},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":376},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":377},{"type":"charslot","id":378},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9f/Avg_bg_bg_newiceforest_1.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":379},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","amount":"0","block":"true","id":380},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":381},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":382},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1021_kroos2_1#5$1","id":383},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝","text":"......","id":384,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a0/Avg_avg_1021_kroos2_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1021_kroos2_1#1$1","id":385},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝","text":"炎国有个说法叫随遇而安，说的大概就是我这样的懒人吧。","id":386,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_1021_kroos2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝","text":"要说有了一大笔钱能做什么......吃些好吃的？给弩加装升级模块？这些平时也在做啊。","id":387,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_1021_kroos2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝","text":"好像，没有什么额外要买的了......你拿去吧。","id":388,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_1021_kroos2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"40","ystrength":"40","vibrato":"40","randomness":"80","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":389},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_140#1","focus":"m","id":390},{"type":"dialogue","name":"山农","text":"一派胡言！","id":391,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/58/Avg_avg_npc_140-1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1021_kroos2_1#2$1","id":392},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝","text":"欸？","id":393,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/ff/Avg_avg_1021_kroos2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":394},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":395},{"type":"charslot","id":396},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7a/Avg_bg_bg_indoor.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":397},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":398},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":399},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":400},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"一派......","id":401},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"40","ystrength":"40","vibrato":"40","randomness":"80","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":402},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_304_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":403},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿尹","text":"一派胡言！","id":404,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_avg_npc_304_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1021_kroos2_1#1$1","id":405},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝","text":"呵......啊，好久没睡这么踏实了。","id":406,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_1021_kroos2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_304_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":407},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿尹","text":"你......你到底睡着了吗！你到底是睁着眼还是闭着眼？这银元宝能为你做点什么，你难道看不见吗！","id":408,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_avg_npc_304_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1021_kroos2_1#2$1","id":409},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝","text":"我会看见我需要看见的东西哦。你希望我，看见什么呢？","id":410,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/ff/Avg_avg_1021_kroos2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":411},{"type":"text","text":"阿尹蓦地收声，不敢再说。","id":412},{"type":"text","text":"似睁非睁的眼睛，看到的并非自己身上易于夺取的钱财，而是自己那些深藏而不可言说之事。","id":413},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1021_kroos2_1#5$1","id":414},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝","text":"你留我的时候，我愿意留下来，是因为你看起来不会轻易放过我。","id":415,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a0/Avg_avg_1021_kroos2_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_304_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":416},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿尹","text":"我......没有......","id":417,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_avg_npc_304_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1021_kroos2_1#4$1","id":418},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝","text":"你特地跟着我，趁着起雾制造那些凌乱的脚印，将你的银元宝藏到易于发现的地方。","id":419,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1a/Avg_avg_1021_kroos2_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝","text":"一、二、三、四、五......","id":420,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1a/Avg_avg_1021_kroos2_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝","text":"一路过来我至少看见了十个坟堆。","id":421,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1a/Avg_avg_1021_kroos2_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1021_kroos2_1#3$1","id":422},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝","text":"那些内讧、斗殴......确实都发生过，对吗？","id":423,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d8/Avg_avg_1021_kroos2_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝","text":"你在这里多少年了？怕是犯下了不少事。","id":424,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d8/Avg_avg_1021_kroos2_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1021_kroos2_1#4$1","id":425},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝","text":"别人的贪念，对你究竟有什么用？","id":426,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1a/Avg_avg_1021_kroos2_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":427},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_smog","fade":"true","fadetime":"2","layer":"2","id":428},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1.5","block":"true","id":429},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":430},{"type":"text","text":"阿尹面色骤变，即刻向克洛丝扑去，却扑了个空。刚才还在冷静分析的卡特斯竟突然消失在了雾里。","id":431},{"type":"dialog","id":432},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":433},{"type":"charslot","id":434},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9f/Avg_bg_bg_newiceforest_1.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":435},{"type":"bgeffect","id":436},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":437},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_smog","fade":"true","fadetime":"2","layer":"2","id":438},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":439},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":440},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_304_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":441},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿尹","text":"哪里去了？","id":442,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_avg_npc_304_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿尹","text":"你莫非是来清算我罪孽的不成？！","id":443,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_avg_npc_304_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":444},{"type":"dialogue","name":"自东边来的声音","text":"怎样的罪孽？","id":445},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_304_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":446},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿尹","text":"哪里？右边？！","id":447,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_avg_npc_304_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":448},{"type":"dialogue","name":"自西边来的声音","text":"说来听听。","id":449},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_304_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":450},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿尹","text":"左边？！","id":451,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_avg_npc_304_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":452},{"type":"dialog","id":453},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_arrow","id":454},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":455},{"type":"text","text":"一支弩箭射入阿尹脚边的雪里，阿尹惊叫一声，后退一步。","id":456},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_304_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":457},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿尹","text":"今天是我的不是，不知得罪了何方圣贤......","id":458,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_avg_npc_304_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿尹","text":"可是，我从未杀过人，这里的人都是被他们自己杀掉的！被他们......自己的贪念！","id":459,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_avg_npc_304_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿尹","text":"你不着我的道，实在是你功德圆满，并无缺憾，我怎么都害不了你的。也求你继续做个好人，放过我吧！","id":460,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_avg_npc_304_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":461},{"type":"dialogue","name":"自上方来的声音","text":"唔......放过你，然后呢？","id":462},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_304_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":463},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿尹","text":"我定会离开这里，改过自新——","id":464,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_avg_npc_304_1$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":465},{"type":"charslot","id":466},{"type":"dialog","id":467},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_arrow","id":468},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":469},{"type":"text","text":"话音未落，一支弩箭穿过浓雾，精准击中了阿尹。她的呼号便也戛然而止。","id":470},{"type":"dialog","id":471},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":472},{"type":"charslot","id":473},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_bg_35_g13_yanlivingroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":474},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":475},{"type":"bgeffect","id":476},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_normal_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":477,"musicid":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":478},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":479},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1021_kroos2_1#5$1","id":480},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝","text":"等我去看的时候，雾突然散了，那名被我射中的女子却也不见了。","id":481,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a0/Avg_avg_1021_kroos2_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avgnew_455_nothing_1#11$1","id":482},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乌有","text":"哎哟不得了啊！克洛丝恩人，我就说那地方有脏东西。","id":483,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avgnew_455_nothing_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avgnew_455_nothing_1#7$1","id":484},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乌有","text":"我看你现在印堂发黑，我这里正好有一枚桃木驱邪符，看在恩人的分上，只要半价——","id":485,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/51/Avg_avgnew_455_nothing_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1021_kroos2_1#4$1","id":486},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝","text":"乌有。","id":487,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1a/Avg_avg_1021_kroos2_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avgnew_455_nothing_1#1$1","id":488},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乌有","text":"开玩笑的，恩人吉人自有天相。","id":489,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/ba/Avg_avgnew_455_nothing_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avgnew_455_nothing_1#8$1","id":490},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乌有","text":"不过，那女子真的跟恩人说，那枚银元宝是炎国的货币？","id":491,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avgnew_455_nothing_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乌有","text":"炎国确有一段时间使用贵金属作为货币，但那已经是很久之前的事了。","id":492,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avgnew_455_nothing_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乌有","text":"不管恩人遇见的是什么，那东西似乎都依靠着人的贪念存活，是以故意引诱恩人。","id":493,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avgnew_455_nothing_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avgnew_455_nothing_1#1$1","id":494},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乌有","text":"恩人没有着她的道，实在是恩人品行清高，志怀霜雪。甚至在我们缺钱的情况下，都没有起心动念。","id":495,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/ba/Avg_avgnew_455_nothing_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1021_kroos2_1#2$1","id":496},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝","text":"啊，对哦，忘了我们缺钱的事了。","id":497,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/ff/Avg_avg_1021_kroos2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1021_kroos2_1#5$1","id":498},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝","text":"不用把我说得这么高尚。贪念我当然是有的。只不过......","id":499,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a0/Avg_avg_1021_kroos2_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝","text":"（只不过，我的贪念，并不是金钱能够满足的罢了......）","id":500,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a0/Avg_avg_1021_kroos2_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝","text":"总之，既然你已经能站起来了，我们就去把......","id":501,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a0/Avg_avg_1021_kroos2_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1021_kroos2_1#10$1","id":502},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝","text":"咦，奇怪，东西呢？","id":503,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_1021_kroos2_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avgnew_455_nothing_1#11$1","id":504},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乌有","text":"......什么东西？","id":505,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avgnew_455_nothing_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1021_kroos2_1#10$1","id":506},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝","text":"那枚银元宝。那个女子被我射中后，地上只剩一枚银元宝。我猜它有些蹊跷，就将它带在身上。这样的怪事在炎国应该由天师来管吧？","id":507,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_1021_kroos2_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avgnew_455_nothing_1#11$1","id":508},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乌有","text":"那丢了可大事不妙啊。","id":509,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avgnew_455_nothing_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1021_kroos2_1#10$1","id":510},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝","text":"唔......","id":511,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_1021_kroos2_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":512},{"type":"playsound","key":"$flashback","volume":"0.8","id":513},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":514},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":515},{"type":"charslot","id":516},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9f/Avg_bg_bg_newiceforest_1.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":517},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0.8","keep":"true","id":518},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":519},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":520},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_140#2","focus":"m","id":521},{"type":"dialogue","name":"山农","text":"这些天总听说有人捡到银元宝，却没人真正见过。看来，真货还在这山上呢。","id":522,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/40/Avg_avg_npc_140-2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":523},{"type":"playsound","key":"$flashback","volume":"0.8","id":524},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":525},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":526},{"type":"charslot","id":527},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_bg_35_g13_yanlivingroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":528},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","amount":"0","block":"true","id":529},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":530},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":531},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1021_kroos2_1#5$1","id":532},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝","text":"虽然不太清楚，但想来不是丢了。","id":533,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a0/Avg_avg_1021_kroos2_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝","text":"因一念之差，伤害了朋友、同伴、陌生人的那些人，最后真的有所得吗？","id":534,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a0/Avg_avg_1021_kroos2_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1021_kroos2_1#9$1","id":535},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克洛丝","text":"......总之，我们去找到天师，将这事说明吧。","id":536,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_1021_kroos2_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":537},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":538},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":539},{"type":"bgeffect","id":540},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":541},{"type":"image","id":542},{"type":"charslot","id":543}],"characters":["乌有","克洛丝","？？？","面色青灰的女子","阿尹","克洛丝？","劫匪","山农","芬","格瑞斯教官","米格鲁","自东边来的声音","自西边来的声音","自上方来的声音"]}